blockquote.para:
The events that add links to a tab or button menu (EVENT_MENU_ACCOUNT, EVENT_MENU_DOCS, EVENT_MENU_MANAGE, EVENT_MENU_MANAGE_CONFIG and EVENT_MENU_SUMMARY) accept, besides HTML links, items given as arrays with the keys url, label, optionally icon and absolute (true if the url is not relative to the MantisBT directory). A callback can return one item or a list of items, for example
return array( 'url' => plugin_page( 'config', true ), 'label' => plugin_lang_get( 'config' ) );
The item is marked as the active one when it is the page the menu is printed for.
